<li><a href="https://www.codzombieguides.com/ascension-remastered" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">codzombieguides.com reference (3) ↗</a></li></ul><p>Select any reference image to enlarge it. Screenshot and symbol sources are credited in the linked walkthroughs; this guide uses local copies for reliable access.</p></section></div></template>
